76837448", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75451774_1870037080170781_4936049721755154926_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dw77Jllc4mQQ7kNvwH5haTH&_nc_oc=AdroFsVaPTkMqYYAblwBA7dmH23vyJk7qFwkSMlNIZGapq2FSVMbcpxzV7ntS39c80M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-DKeHNY_JaK0ch_IXMZt5zLQta_AZfIAMst3u3DZAeUw&oe=6A4292E5"}, "display_name": "Harpagun", "keywords": ["Harpagun", "VR", "FPS", "Gun"], "long_description": "Be Harpagun. Get stranded on a deserted planet. Accidentally destroy your own rocket. Be swarmed by insane critters. Wreck stuff, throw aliens. Argue with your useless crew. Smash more enemies. Meet a girl. Have hallucinations. Listen to slav beats. Shoot living grenades.\n\nThis a game. In VR. With story and stuff. Also combat. A lot of combat. It\u2019s good - you have weapons but won\u2019t use them cause it\u2019s more fun to take a washing machine and slam it into an alien\u2019s head.\n\nYou can move stuff with a gravity ray. Enemies too, just yeet them into a wall or something and they die.\n\n\nIt\u2019s an arcade game. You know, one of the ones you actually have fun playing. Like an on-rails-shooter but not really because you can move around and don\u2019t puke. Just try it, it works. If not - return to sender, spend money on other stuff.", "short_description": "Harpagun is a fast-paced VR shooter where you smash alien critters, argue with your dysfunctional crew, and destroy everything in sight. Use weapons or everyday objects with a gravity ray to wreak havoc. Built for VR, it delivers chaotic fun, immersive combat, and a wild, hilarious storyline."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://somethingrandom.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Something Random", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://somethingrandom.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags